WEBVTT

00:17:57.954 --> 00:18:03.329
leadership. Yes, because brave
leadership puts demands

00:18:03.329 --> 00:18:08.871
on people to also be courageous,
to also be self-aware,

00:18:09.788 --> 00:18:13.954
to also put more importance on getting
things right than being right.

00:18:15.329 --> 00:18:19.621
I don't think brave leadership
for the leader or for

00:18:20.038 --> 00:18:24.246
the people who are being led
is for the faint of heart.

00:18:24.246 --> 00:18:28.829
So I'm not so sure that everyone wants
courageous leadership. And that's.